    "/twitter/send_tweet_v3": {
      "post": {
        "description": "V3 Send Tweet API - Send a tweet using your username. This is an asynchronous method that queues your tweet for posting. You must have logged in via user_login_v3 first. Supports text, images, GIFs, and videos. Trial operation price: $0.003 per call.",
